{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0308","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0308:00000039:text","row":39957,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"「降伏します」","en":"“I surrender.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904665","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0015b:00001","en":"Taichi: \"I capitulate.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0308:00000082:text","row":39958,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"「動かないで下さい。撃ちますよ……って、え？」","en":"“Don’t move. I’ll shoot... Wait, what?”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904666","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0015b:00002","en":"Kiri: \"Please do not move. I will shoot... wait, eh?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0308:000000d0:text","row":39959,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"「降参です」","en":"“I give up.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904667","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0015b:00003","en":"Taichi: \"I surrender.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0308:000000f4:text","row":39960,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"壁に手をついて足を開けと言われる前に壁に手をついて足を開いた。","en":"Before anyone could order me to put my hands on the wall and spread my legs, I put my hands on the wall and spread my legs.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904668","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0015b:00004","en":"I put my hands on the wall and spread my legs before I was told to put my hands on the wall and spread my legs.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0308:0000014a:text","row":39961,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"降伏の姿勢だ。","en":"The universal posture of surrender.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904669","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0015b:00005","en":"The posture of surrender.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0308:00000195:text","row":39962,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"「よわぁ……」","en":"“So weak...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904670","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0015b:00006","en":"Miki: \"Weeeak...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0308:000001f0:text","row":39963,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"「……どうしよう、美希？」","en":"“...What do we do, Miki?”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904671","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0015b:00007","en":"Kiri: \"...what do we do, Miki?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0308:00000247:text","row":39964,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"「えっと……どうしようって言われても……可哀相だよ」","en":"“Um... I don’t know... I just feel sorry for him.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904672","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0015b:00008","en":"Miki: \"Uhmmm... what do we do you ask... but he's so pitiful!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0308:000002b6:text","row":39965,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"「全然可哀相じゃないよ、こんな人」","en":"“There's nothing to feel sorry for. Not with someone like him.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904673","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0015b:00009","en":"Kiri: \"This guy here isn't pitiful, not at all.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0308:00000315:text","row":39966,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"「だって、霧ちん武器もって一方的すぎるよ。人に向けたらよくない……」","en":"“But you've got a weapon, Kiri-kins. It's totally one-sided. You shouldn't point that at people...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904674","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0015b:00010","en":"Miki: \"But Kiri-chin, arming yourself when he didn't is just going too far! Pointing that at people isn't nice...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0308:00000394:text","row":39967,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"「……だって」","en":"“...But...”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904675","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0015b:00011","en":"Kiri: \"...but.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0308:000003df:text","row":39968,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"「やめよ、ね？」","en":"“Let's stop, okay?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904676","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0015b:00012","en":"Miki: \"Let's stop, OK?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0308:0000042a:text","row":39969,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"「……わかった」","en":"“...Okay.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904677","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0015b:00013","en":"Kiri: \"...I get it.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0308:00000452:text","row":39970,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"不承不承ではあったが。","en":"She agreed, though reluctantly.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904678","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0015b:00014","en":"Albeit grudgingly and reluctantly.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0308:00000488:text","row":39971,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"「手おろしていい？」","en":"“Can I put my hands down?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904679","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0015b:00015","en":"Taichi: \"Can I lower my hands?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0308:000004d7:text","row":39972,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"「……どうぞ」","en":"“...Go ahead.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904680","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0015b:00016","en":"Kiri: \"...go on.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0308:00000505:text","row":39973,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"「ふー、助かった、美希」","en":"“Phew. You saved me, Miki.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904681","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0015b:00017","en":"Taichi: \"Wheeew, you saved me, Miki.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0308:0000055a:text","row":39974,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ、いえ」","en":"“Oh, no problem.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904682","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0015b:00018","en":"Miki: \"Ah, it's nothing.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0308:0000057e:text","row":39975,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"ええ子だ。","en":"What a sweetheart.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904683","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0015b:00019","en":"Nyce gal she.","verdict":"questionable","categories":["grammar","register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0308:000005a0:text","row":39976,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"さて、どっちかをうまくアレしないとな。","en":"Now I just had to... you know... do that thing with one of them.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904684","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0015b:00020","en":"So then, shouldn't I just do a deliciously ambiguous \"That\" to one of these two.","verdict":"questionable","categories":["addition","register_voice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0308:00000606:choice:01","row":39977,"ordinal":21,"kind":"choice","jp":"霧","en":"Kiri","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0308:00000606:choice:02","row":39978,"ordinal":22,"kind":"choice","jp":"美希","en":"Miki","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[]}]}
